## Findings
- Lease-bound invocation: 3/3 sessions sent `weixue:proactive:<id>:<lease>` with the id of the poll answer; main's server delivered each (`delivering … invoked=True`), none hit `no current lease`.
- Receipt round-trip: the loopback approve got `agent receipt: approve seq=11 … result=accepted` 20 ms after sending. On main's server that receipt preceded `agent-service /v1/chats/c_035043/approve: HTTP 404` (the fixture chat does not exist): the F04 defect. This branch receipts it `stale` (sim round F04, unit tests).
- Release boot: the boot snapshot still held the fixture approval card and played the `needs_you` earcon once at the stored output volume (100); no speech played on the release build. The fixture tasks were then dropped; the board is left on the release build with an empty task store (`sync listed=0`).
- Not shown on the board: the server-side binding requirement (needs this branch deployed; unit tests and sim device), and receipts after agent-service answered (sim round F04).
